title: "Cahn-Hilliard-Darcy-SAV: Python implementation of a fully decoupled SAV scheme for the Cahn–Hilliard–Darcy system"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-03
url: "https://github.com/FarinFar89/Cahn-Hilliard-Darcy-SAV"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FarinFar89/Cahn-Hilliard-Darcy-SAV"
keywords:
  - Cahn-Hilliard equation
  - Darcy flow
  - Scalar Auxiliary Variable
  - SAV scheme
  - Fourier spectral method
  - GPU acceleration
  - Scientific computing
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Python implementation of a fully decoupled, linear, and second-order accurate
  Scalar Auxiliary Variable scheme for the Cahn–Hilliard–Darcy system of
  two-phase Hele–Shaw flow. This repository accompanies the Master's thesis
  developed at the University of Koblenz in 2026.
